# HX 規矩頁（跨機）

可見 SoT：`HX/hx-rules.html`（網上 `https://danson117.github.io/HX/hx-rules.html`）。

- 呢個倉額外新規則：**先寫入該 HTML（紅字）**，再寫本地 `.mdc`。唔可以只寫本地。
- 另一部機：開該 HTML。紅字＝未對齊／新加。對齊完先可轉普通色。
- After every local HX / repo update that should live on GitHub, **commit and `git push` immediately** (same turn). Do not leave work only on this PC. If several versions were never pushed, **push the latest** (one commit of current state is enough). Do not push secrets. Do not force-push. Do not skip hooks unless the user asked.
- 每次本機更新（應上 GitHub）**即刻 commit + push**。之前漏咗就 **push 而家最新**（一次 commit 夠）。唔 push 秘密；唔 force。
- After an HX update, **do not open a new browser / Chrome**. Tell the user the **page version number(s)** in the chat. The user will **manually refresh** the tab they already have.
- 改完 HX **唔好開新 browser / Chrome**。喺對話講 **version 號** 就得；用戶自己 refresh 已開嘅 tab。
- 右下角 `page-version` **必 +0.1**（大改 +1.0）。`hx.html` 側欄 `?v=` 一齊加。
- 零碎筆記：畫面唔顯示「記下」／時間／caption。時間只留 `#scratch-ledger`。
- Training Team Board ingest：**no silent skip**。認唔到或做唔到必要步驟 → 彈窗、整份檔 REJECT、唔寫入。詳見 `HX/hx-rules.html` 紅字 **Ingest reject**。
